<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Fosfertil upgraded to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Fosfertil upgraded to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Fator Securities said it raised its rating on Brazil's Fosfertil shares to hold from sell.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We believe the stock is trading at a fair price,&quot; the firm said in a report.</p>
<p>-- For the Brazilian fertilizer sector, Fator forecasts a four percent rise in 1997 physical sales, expects prices to remain unchanged and sees a small drop in gross margins.</p>
<p>-- Fosfertil preferred shares were trading at 4.25 reais, up 4.42 percent, on Wednesday.</p>
<p>((-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415))</p>
